# Rename to CITATION.cff and commit at the repo root of k8s-timeline
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: k8s-timeline
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-14
authors:
  - family-names: Sampathi
    given-names: Shiva
repository-code: https://github.com/agentbantu-wq/k8s-timeline
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reconstruct a Kubernetes incident timeline straight from cluster state —
  events, pod/container signals, rollout activity, and node conditions
  into one unified chronological timeline. Stdlib-only Python, zero
  dependencies; emits postmortem-copilot-compatible JSON via --pmc.
keywords:
  - kubernetes
  - incident-response
  - site-reliability-engineering
  - observability
  - timeline
